---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="board" number="01" label="Board" title="Everything else is a chat window.">
  <p class="sub">
    Same agent, same work. A transcript makes you scroll back and rebuild it in your head. A
    board just shows you. Every task, every session, one screen.
  </p>
  <div class="pair">
    <div class="transcript" aria-hidden="true">
      <p>I've finished the auth refactor and moved on to the retry queue.</p>
      <p>The migration is blocked on the schema change from earlier, so I paused it.</p>
      <p>Tests are green on the export fix. Want me to open a PR?</p>
      <p>Also, quick question about the rate limiter config…</p>
      <p>Picking the payments task back up now.</p>
    </div>
    <img
      class="shot"
      src="/shots/overview.jpg"
      alt="The same work on the Dispatch overview: one failed run, four waiting for review"
      width="1680"
      height="960"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .transcript {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    font-size: var(--site-text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .transcript p {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  .transcript p:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .pair .shot {
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: left top;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .pair .shot {
      height: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
